
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant S as Spring
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant RS as RecommendService
    participant AR as Anchor Resolver
    participant SC as Scorer.topk
    participant EMB as Embedding Model (SentenceTransformer)
    participant MV as Milvus
    participant DB as Cloud SQL
    participant LLM as Gemini (LLM Rerank)

    S->>API: POST /recommend
    API->>RS: recommend(user, top_k, ...)

    Note over RS,AR: Anchor resolution
    RS->>AR: resolve anchor
    alt last selected coords available
        AR->>RS: last selected coords
    else accomAddress 있음
        AR->>DB: Google Geocode coords
    else region provided
        AR->>RS: region coords (geo_centers)
    else default
        AR->>RS: default coords (env)
    end

    loop category tourspot/cafe/restaurant
        RS->>EMB: encode(user_text)
        EMB-->>RS: user_vec

        RS->>SC: topk(initial_k=max(top_k*2,15))
        SC->>MV: vector search (candidate_k = min(max(initial_k*20,100),1000))
        MV-->>SC: candidate_ids + dense_scores
        SC->>DB: fetch_meta (lat/lng/meta/popularity)

        SC->>SC: recency_vec = normalize(history_vec + behavior_vec (time decay))
        SC->>SC: score=base+recency+distance+popularity
        SC->>SC: distance filter + meta validation
        SC-->>RS: candidates

        RS->>RS: remove history
        RS->>LLM: rerank(candidates)
        LLM-->>RS: top_k results
    end

    RS-->>API: final recommendations
    API-->>S: response
